COMPILATION OF: E46N14

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N14

   1 a 0000 E46N14:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] RUNTIME: THREE SUCCESSIVE BARE FILE
   4 a 0006      SKIPs between two items.  E46N11 has one; three minus
   5 a 0006      one, divided by two, is the bytes of one skip even if
   6 a 0006      a skip is not a fixed length. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N14OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A');
  10 c 003D   put file(outf) skip;
  11 c 0051   put file(outf) skip;
  12 c 0065   put file(outf) skip;
  13 c 0079   put file(outf) list('B');
  14 c 0093   close file(outf);
  15 c 0099   stop;
  16 a 009C end E46N14;

CODE SIZE = 009C
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3884
END  COMPILATION
